{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e8ed7b97-8825-8be4-ad86-d6d585d8353b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-16T13:34:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Antonella Lombardozzi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:32:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:33:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I need the trash and recycling schedule for the holiday week. Is it changing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:33:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Let me pull that up. What's the address you're on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:33:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "159 Farewell Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:33:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "159 Farewell, North End. Okay, and you're asking about the week of Christmas, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:33:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Christmas week and the New Year's week too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:33:25-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So, usually when the holiday falls on a weekday, pickup slides back one day for the rest of that week. For your street, that would put your regular day a day later. Let me double check that against the calendar here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:33:41-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:33:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Christmas week, everything after the holiday shifts one day later. Same thing for New Year's week. Then it goes back to normal the week after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:33:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So Tuesday pickup becomes Wednesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:33:55-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, if your pickup is Tuesday, Christmas is a Thursday, so you'd be before the holiday and not affected that week. New Year's is also a Thursday, so same thing. It's only Thursday and Friday routes that slide."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:34:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Mine's Tuesday. So no change."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:34:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, no change for Tuesday. I'll note that down. Tuesday, both weeks, normal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:34:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is there a fee for any of that? A holiday pickup charge or anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:34:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no fee. It's just the regular service, only the days move."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:34:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. You have a calm voice, by the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:34:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, thank you. I'll take it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:34:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all I needed. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:34:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:34:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
